<title>UK: SQUASH-LATEST MEN'S WORLD RANKINGS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-LATEST MEN'S WORLD RANKINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest men's world rankings issued</p>
<p>by the Professional Squash Association (PSA) on Friday:</p>
<p>1. Jansher Khan (Pakistan)</p>
<p>2. Rodney Eyles (Australia)</p>
<p>3. Peter Nicol (Scotland)</p>
<p>4. Chris Walker (England)</p>
